; threshold_bridge.room - Ponte Velha: a broken stone bridge (deck row 5) over a dry ravine, the first enemy
; (design 04 section 3.2). The gap (cols 17-22) is one running jump; the fallen span (cols 18-22, top row 8)
; climbs out of the ravine by single jumps. Base kit only.
; WORLD-35: the icefall's shaft (threshold_icefall_foot cols 1-2, here 21-22) drops onto the fallen span, which reaches
; col 22 so the whole shaft lands on it, into deep snow: a SoftLanding (`n`, 21,7; 6 cells wide, 6 tall, over the deck's
; west end too) under the snow drift prop, so the 2.4 s fall is no hard landing ("Straight drop into deep snow
; (Recommended)", user, 2026-10-15). threshold_icefall_foot leaves rows 9-11 open over the east deck, so its jump is
; not capped. The ravine's west wall is a [secret] (cols 10-12, rows 8-11, cracked at 12,10, a draft at 13,10) that
; drops through row 11 into threshold_ravine_cave; [back] earth lines it.

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = threshold

